<title>USA: MidAmerican Energy files $500 mln shelf debt.</title>
<headline>MidAmerican Energy files $500 mln shelf debt.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>MidAmerican Energy Co filed Friday a shelf registration with the Securities and Exchange Commission to offer up to $500 million in medium-term notes.</p>
<p>Net proceeds will be used to repay debt, the Des Moines, Iowa, electric and natural gas public utility said.</p>
<p>No underwriters were named in the filing.</p>
</text>
